{
  "name": "m-churchill",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 57.017,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "This British officer fought the Second World War with a sword, a longbow and bagpipes.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.584,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "0bd10ae3ec11"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Everyone else carried rifles.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.454,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "ea5d507043dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.2,
      "text": "He'd shot arrows for Britain at the world championships.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.664,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "ea5d507043dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "So when his commandos raided Norway that December, he went ashore playing the bagpipes.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.114,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "ea5d507043dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Two years later, in Italy, he was sent to take a German post above Salerno.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.46,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "eab90562ba89"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He took one corporal.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.356,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "eab90562ba89"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.2,
      "text": "They came back with forty-two prisoners, a mortar crew included.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.451,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "eab90562ba89"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "But he'd lost his sword in the fight.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.918,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "eab90562ba89"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "So he walked back into the town to get it.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.628,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "eab90562ba89"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Then came the island of Brač, off Yugoslavia.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.41,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "96b1dd56ab34"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A mortar shell killed or wounded everyone but him.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.462,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "96b1dd56ab34"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So he played the bagpipes as the Germans advanced.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.135,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "96b1dd56ab34"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.2,
      "text": "The song was \"Will Ye No Come Back Again?\"",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.313,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "96b1dd56ab34"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "Then a grenade knocked him out.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.294,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "96b1dd56ab34"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The Germans flew him to Berlin for questioning, because of his surname.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.203,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "b5758d3cd01d"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "They thought he was related to Winston Churchill.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.916,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "b5758d3cd01d"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "He wasn't.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.982,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "b5758d3cd01d"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So they locked him in Sachsenhausen.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.723,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "b5758d3cd01d"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "He tunnelled out, and they caught him again.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.521,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "b5758d3cd01d"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Videos online say that in France, in 1940, he killed a German with that longbow.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.315,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "ebbd96e3fd84"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "But Churchill himself said a truck had crushed his bows.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.687,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "ebbd96e3fd84"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "The man who took a sword to a gun war outlived it by fifty years.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-churchill/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.427,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "fd658e979dfd"
    }
  ]
}
